				},
				{
					"id": 230381102,
					"content": "#旅、旅行者？{F#妳}{M#你}怎麼來了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381103,
					"content": "我從扎卡里亞那裡帶藥來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381104,
					"content": "#那{F#妳}{M#你}應該也聽說了我的事吧，真是不好意思…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381105,
					"content": "你先把藥給喝了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381106,
					"content": "喔…好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381107,
					"content": "馬魯夫喝下了藥劑…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381108,
					"content": "呼…我感覺好一些了，扎卡里亞醫生的醫術果然高超啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381109,
					"content": "你為什麼要改藥方？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230381110,
					"content": "#上次我不是和{F#妳}{M#你}一起做了一副藥嗎？不知道為什麼。那副藥的藥效不太好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381111,
					"content": "我猜測也許是製作方式出了差錯，或者是少了什麼藥材。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381112,
					"content": "所以我就…那個…按照我自己的經驗，重新煮了一鍋藥。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381113,
					"content": "為了安全起見，我就先自己試了一口藥，然後就這樣了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381114,
					"content": "#我剛託人去找扎卡里亞醫生，拜託他幫我開點藥。沒想到{F#妳}{M#你}這麼快就把藥送過來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381115,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}了，旅行者。我再休息一下，就要去重新開診了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381116,
					"content": "休診這麼長時間，村裡一定有很多患者等著看病呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230381117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230381117,
					"content": "唉，但是我的藥材好像又不夠了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "馬魯夫"
				}
			]
